## Integration with Development Workflow

### Pre-Commit Hook Prompt
```bash
# .git/hooks/pre-commit
#!/bin/bash
echo "Running CLARITY check..."
llm --prompt "Quick CLARITY scan of staged files" $(git diff --cached --name-only)
```

### CI/CD Integration Prompt
```yaml
# .github/workflows/clarity-check.yml
- name: CLARITY Analysis
  run: |
    llm analyze --template clarity \
      --files $(git diff origin/main --name-only) \
      --output clarity-report.md
```

### IDE Integration (Cursor/VSCode)
```json
{
  "clarity.autoAnalyze": true,
  "clarity.onSave": "quick-scan",
  "clarity.onPR": "detailed-audit"
}
```

